<title>HONG KONG: Cathay Pacific links with Sabre &amp; IBM.</title>
<headline>Cathay Pacific links with Sabre &amp; IBM.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cathay Pacific, Sabre Group and IBM have reached a 10 year agreement to give Cathay a package of information technology business solutions, a joint statement from the companies said.</p>
<p>Under the deal, IBM and Sabre will be Cathay's preferred information technology suppliers and help it develop and manage a variety of systems.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect this strategic relationship to significantly enhance Cathay's service excellence and profitability,&quot; said Ian Riddell, Cathay's general manager for information management.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017</p>
